    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur plonge sous l’eau au\n1er tour et frappe au 2è. Permet\naussi de plonger au fond de l’eau.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diving on the first turn, the user\nfloats up and attacks on the second.\nIt can be used for diving in the ocean.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diving on the first turn, the user\nfloats up and attacks on the second.\nIt can be used for diving in the ocean.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "１ターンめで　もぐり　２ターンめに\nうきあがって　こうげきする。うみの\nなかに　もぐる　ことも　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "1턴째에 잠수했다가 2턴째에\n떠올라 공격한다.\n바닷속 깊숙이 잠수할 수도 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur plonge sous l’eau au premier tour et\nfrappe au second.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Taucht in Runde 1 ab und greift in Runde 2\naus der Tiefe an. Ermöglicht Tauchgänge zum\nMeeresgrund.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Puedes obtenerlo en el Casino. Tiene capacidad\npara 50 000 Fichas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa si tuffa in acqua per emergere e\nattaccare al turno seguente.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diving on the first turn, the user floats\nup and attacks on the next turn.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "１ターン目で　潜り　２ターン目に\n浮きあがって　攻撃する。\n海の　奥深くに　潜ることも　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Puedes obtenerlo en el Casino. Tiene capacidad\npara 50 000 Fichas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "パンチで　こうげき。　あいての\nぼうぎょを　さげる　ことが　ある。\nいわを　くだくことも　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "펀치로 공격한다.\n상대의 방어를 떨어뜨릴 때가 있으며\n바위를 깰 수도 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用拳頭進行攻擊。\n有時會降低對手的防禦。\n也可以擊碎岩石。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Porte un coup de poing à l’ennemi qui peut\nbaisser sa Défense. Peut aussi briser des rochers\nfissurés.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender greift mit einem Hieb an, der den\nVerteidigungs-Wert des Zieles senken kann.\nDamit können auch Steine zerschlagen werden.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataca con los puños. Puede bajar la Defensa del\nobjetivo y romper rocas fuera del combate.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa colpisce il bersaglio con un pugno\nche può anche ridurne la Difesa. Fuori dalla lotta\npermette di frantumare le rocce.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks with a punch. This may also lower\nthe target’s Defense stat. This move can also\nshatter rocks in the field.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
